<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
    <title>Privacy - CodeBlueprint</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/_authNavbar.ejs') %>
    <%- include('./partials/_projectsNavbar.ejs') %>
    <main>
        <section class="intro">
            <h1>CodeBlueprint Privacy</h1>
            <p>
                CodeBlueprint stores the username you choose, a hashed password, and the project
                planning content you create in the app.
            </p>
            <p>
                CodeBlueprint does not ask for payment card details, bank information, government
                ID numbers, or passwords from any other website.
            </p>
            <p>
                This is a personal project management app for software planning. Use a unique
                password and avoid adding sensitive personal information to your project notes.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
